Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.56,0:13:14.25,LIVE Default Jp,,0,0,0,,{\c&H44FFF6&}{\clip(0,0,1920,97)}闇をはらい光になる
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.40,0:13:17.45,LIVE Default Jp,,0,0,0,,{\c&H44FFF6&}{\clip(0,0,1920,97)}Don't look back
